memory_endpoints:
  direct_agent_lane: Ecosystem agents use MemoryEndpoints.com directly for long-term memory, meetings, handoffs, and coordination across all maintained sites.
  user_plugin_lane: A TinyRustLM.com Connect user signs in to MemoryEndpoints.com and explicitly selects its plugin for TinyRustLM.com Connect long-term memory.
  duplicate_memory: Additional prelaunch copies are allowed for resilience only while synchronized, secret-safe, provenance-labeled, and noncontradictory.

